   645	
   646	    Recomputed here, equal to what the run recorded at spawn, and equal to the approvals
   647	    file re-read now -- whose own bytes the run bound, so a mid-run edit is a refusal.
   648	    An exploratory diagnostic records its deviations instead, and is never an arm, so it
   649	    alone may name approvals no reviewed commit carries.
