Author: Yixun-Hu <yixunhu21@gmail.com>
Commit: Yixun-Hu <yixunhu21@gmail.com>

    exp06: a registered HAA artefact is a regular file of the smoke tree
    
    Codex pre-launch finding 1. confined(path, root, label) walks every component
    below the resolved run directory with lstat and refuses a symlink anywhere, so
    the allow-list can no longer be satisfied by a name that resolves outside
    ckpt/exp06/_smoke. haa_smoke_artifacts confines the artefact directory and
    args.json before reading it and passes root to artifacts(), which now checks
    every registered file -- args.json and provenance.json included -- before
    hashing it. The other run types keep the previous behaviour (root=None).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
